{"id":"1a95499a684ff3a3","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf.md","title":"高阶随机点计算高阶不动点自由函数","display":"thm-nrandom-n-fpf — 高阶随机点计算高阶不动点自由函数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf","aliases":["43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf"],"display":"thm-nrandom-n-fpf — 高阶随机点计算高阶不动点自由函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-n-fpf]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 11.12.3 (Kučera)","source_printed_pages":"279–281","source_pdf_pages":"299–301","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nrandom-n-fpf — 高阶随机点计算高阶不动点自由函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58b618e19527154c\" href=\"?note=58b618e19527154c\" title=\"43-df-n-fpf\">43-df-n-fpf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.12.3 (Kučera)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"279–281"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"299–301"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NFPF}\">\\(\\operatorname{NFPF}\\)</span>、函数归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"58b618e19527154c\" href=\"?note=58b618e19527154c\" title=\"43-df-n-fpf\">43-df-n-fpf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中标题简写n随机计算n-FPF，但精确编号定理使用n+1随机；本原子按正式陈述保留正确移位。n=0得到随机点计算通常FPF函数。核对了分层与源证明目标，未独立重演列编码和Sacks跳跃反演。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.12.3 (Kučera)；印刷页279–281，PDF页299–301。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-n-fpf","status":"resolved","id":"58b618e19527154c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-n-fpf]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}$、$\\operatorname{NFPF}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-n-fpf]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-n-fpf","status":"resolved","id":"58b618e19527154c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}$、$\\operatorname{NFPF}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-n-fpf]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}$、$\\operatorname{NFPF}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-n-fpf]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NFPF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{NFPF}(f,n)).","display":true}],"bytes":1545,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-nrandom-n-fpf]] — 高阶随机点计算高阶不动点自由函数"}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9","58b618e19527154c","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}